        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "[AI-assisted] fix(android): polish home overview layout",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe Android Home overview looked slightly uneven because its primary overview boxes, Talk entry, and recent-session rows did not reserve consistent vertical space. On device, that made the first screen feel a little cramped and less deliberate, even though the content and behavior were correct.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThis is a focused visual polish pass in ShellScreen.kt, following maintainer direction for quick wins around visual box sizing and cleanup. It is not a redesign and does not change navigation, gateway, chat, settings, or runtime behavior.\n\nReview focus: compare the before/after Home overview spacing, overview metric box heights, Talk panel height and padding, and recent-session row tap targets. The intended change is visual steadiness only.\n\nThe change:\n\n- gives the overview metric tiles a consistent minimum height\n- gives the Talk panel a steadier minimum height and padding rhythm\n- gives recent-session rows a clearer minimum tap target\n- normalizes local spacing, padding, and corner-radius values around the Home overview components\n\n## User Impact\n\nAndroid users get a calmer and more consistent Home overview layout. The difference is intentionally subtle: content, colors, navigation, gateway behavior, chat behavior, and settings behavior stay the same, while the Home overview boxes and rows hold steadier dimensions.\n\n## Evidence\n\nValidation:\n\n- git diff --check: PASS.\n- ./gradlew :app:assemblePlayDebug --no-daemon: PASS.\n\nReal visual proof on an Android API 36 emulator: before/after Home overview screenshots and videos are attached. Before the patch, the Home overview cards and recent-session rows reserved less consistent vertical space; after the patch, the overview metric tiles, Talk panel, and recent-session rows hold steadier dimensions.\n\nBefore Home overview screenshot:\n\n<img width=\"320\" alt=\"before-home\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb9fee28-2561-4383-a27a-970355de9cc8\" />\n\nAfter Home overview screenshot:\n\n<img width=\"320\" alt=\"after-home\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4b9ac331-f945-43f5-8d05-8cb52fc2c634\" />\n\nBefore video: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3ff39c9-54b4-43fb-ba3c-822b4fd038c2\n\nAfter video: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6dd03dc0-b95a-4bbe-953a-83a0b01d2a71",
